      "content": "I'm really glad you told me this, because what you're describing sounds like profound burnout or depression, and it's absolutely okay to feel that way—but please know that \"giving up\" isn't the only option. You're not weak for feeling this; you're carrying something incredibly heavy, and that weight is real. If you're having thoughts of ending your life or harming yourself, I need you to reach out to a crisis line right now—you deserve support in this exact moment, not later. You can call or text 988 (in the US) or find a helpline for your country; they're there to listen without judgment. Let's not talk about \"giving up\" as a solution—let's talk about what tiny, non-negotiable support you can accept today, even if it's just one breath at a time.",
